Either a fresh Ubuntu or upgrade an existing Ubuntu 22.04.

If upgrade was chosen then check the nvidia driver! If the system doesn't use proprietary driver then run:

$ sudo ubuntu-drivers install

this should install the nvidia drivers required for this machine.

Check with:

$ nvidia-smi
Tue Apr  7 11:56:29 2026       
